    - target: {fileID: 1881534070420041712, guid: b57e20b9f2df91e42a4c142e53793094, type: 3}
      propertyPath: desc
      value: "We\u2019ve rolled out some exciting small updates and new features
        to make your SnapGram experience smoother, smarter, and more fun!\n\n\u2022
        New <b>profile customization</b> options: Add emojis, badges, and background
        themes to your bio.  \n\u2022 Introducing the <b>Daily Streak Tracker</b>:
        Earn bonus points just for checking in!  \n\u2022 Expanded <b>reaction emojis</b>:
        Express yourself even more in stories and chats.  \n\u2022 Smarter <b>group
        challenges</b>: Auto-team matching pairs you instantly with like-minded users. 
        \n\u2022 Plus: <b>Bug fixes</b>, <b>performance boosts</b>, and <b>cleaner
        notifications</b>.\n\nAll these tweaks are here to help you connect, create,
        and climb the leaderboard with ease.\n\n<size=110%><color=#B4114B><b>Update
        your app today and explore what\u2019s new!</b></color></size>  \n#SnapGramUpdates
        #StaySnappy\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1881534070420041712, guid: b57e20b9f2df91e42a4c142e53793094, type: 3}
